# The shop (Docs/Design/83-dialogue-trees.md): what a keeper says when a wolf comes to the counter, from Trade on the
# wheel. Short, as a shop is in any RPG: two clicks to the goods (Trade, then 1 or Enter), four choices at most. The
# keeper's lines are talk concepts (dlg.shop.<node>): a trade's, a dialect's or a resident's own rule outranks these.
# The player's choices are plain words, a default line they may send as it is or rewrite in their own words.
#
# here.shop: open, asleep (the keeper is asleep: they mumble, and there is nothing to buy), bare (nothing on the
# shelf; one may still sell). here.giver: work this keeper's market offers, or work of the player's to ask after (the
# work tree goes on from "Any work going?": doc 83, Phase 2). topic.meeting: stranger or known;
# topic.player: the name they were given, if they were.

tree shop
for role=merchant
entry trade greet

node greet
say #greet#, #address#. Looking or buying? | #greet#. #shop_offer#
say[topic.meeting=known] #greet#, #topic.player#. #shop_offer# | Back again, #topic.player#? #shop_offer#
say[here.came_in=yes] #greet#. Come in, come in. #shop_offer# | #greet#. Have a look around.
say[here.shop=bare priority=2] #greet#. #shop_bare# I'll still buy, mind. | #shop_bare# What are you selling?
say[here.shop=asleep priority=10] #shop_asleep#
say[here.shop=asleep trade=baker priority=10] Mm... the ovens are cold... come back at dawn.
say[trade=baker] #greet#, #address#. Bread's warm, loaves and pies. | #greet#. Loaves and pies, fresh. Looking or buying?
say[trade=smith] #greet#. Mind the forge. #shop_offer# | #greet#, #address#. Tools or iron?
say[trade=brewer] #greet#. Thirsty? #shop_offer# | #greet#, #address#. Ale's good this week.
say[topic.meeting=returning priority=6] Well, well. I've not seen you since #topic.since#. #shop_offer# | Look who it is. Not since #topic.since#! #shop_offer#
say[topic.meeting=famous priority=6] You #topic.deed#, didn't you? Folk talk of it still. #shop_offer# | So you're the one who #topic.deed#. #shop_offer#
say[topic.meeting=famous_look priority=6] You look like the one who #topic.deed#. Are you? #shop_offer# | I've heard of a wolf like you, who #topic.deed#. #shop_offer#
say[pair.disposition=wary priority=3] Yes? | What is it you want? | #greet#. Looking or buying?
say[pair.disposition=hostile priority=10] You. Say what you want and go. | What now? | Buy something or be on your way.
mood warm
choice Let me see your wares. [here.shop=open|bare] -> do shop
choice Any work going? [here.shop=open|bare here.giver=yes] -> do open work
choice What's dear today? [here.shop=open|bare] -> prices
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node prices
ask player.trade
say #shop_dear# #shop_offer# | Nothing's moved much. #shop_offer#
choice Let me see your wares. [here.shop=open|bare] -> do shop
choice Goodbye for now. -> bye

node bye
say #farewell#. | #shop_bye# | #farewell#, #address#.
say[here.shop=asleep priority=10] Mm.
end
